 When $i=1$, $s_i=\replacedVerb {L}$, and $c(1,0)=0$;

 When $i=2$, $s_i=\replacedVerb {L}$, and $c(1,1)=1$, since there is only one distinct number in $a_1$;

 When $i=3$, $s_i=\replacedVerb {R}$, and $c(4,3)=0$.

